    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Purple Innovation sustained positive momentum in its owned showrooms, with comparable sales rising for a third straight quarter, while e-commerce trends showed gradual improvement. The launch of the premium Purple Royale line through Mattress Firm provided early wholesale traction, reinforcing the brand’s push into higher-end segments and supporting channel diversification. The commentary points to stabilizing demand without referencing acute macro or competitive disruptions, suggesting a steady, if measured, recovery trajectory.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership emphasized consistency and channel execution, reaffirming full-year profitability guidance and signaling sequential performance gains into the second quarter. The tone reflects a team methodically rebuilding operational reliability, leveraging product innovation and wholesale partnerships to broaden distribution. The decision to reiterate guidance amid ongoing turnaround efforts indicates management confidence and a commitment to credibility as they seek to translate operational improvement into sustained financial progress.",
